    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Mind Snare</strong> is a dark adventure that blends rich storytelling, clever puzzles, and action challenges inside a dungeon filled with deadly traps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a protagonist who has lost his memory, you must help rebuild his convictions while exploring treacherous corridors, making decisions that will permanently affect the fate of everyone around you, and trying to discover who locked you inside this nightmare.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849090/extras/060becc29d434dad30cebd4c1c77df5b.avif?t=1755181027\" width=800 height=366 /></span>With an innovative conviction's system, every choice not only shapes the ending but also the hero\u2019s personality, offering multiple paths and distinct finales.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849090/extras/bb1f6c2228b51acebca010b1af916455.avif?t=1755181027\" width=800 height=366 /></span><br>\u2694\ufe0f Test your reflexes, your strategic thinking, and your detective skills to survive \u2014 in this labyrinth, nothing comes for free, and every detail might be the key to uncovering the truth\u2026 or escaping from it.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Mind Snare</strong> is a dark adventure that blends rich storytelling, clever puzzles, and action challenges inside a dungeon filled with deadly traps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a protagonist who has lost his memory, you must help rebuild his convictions while exploring treacherous corridors, making decisions that will permanently affect the fate of everyone around you, and trying to discover who locked you inside this nightmare.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849090/extras/060becc29d434dad30cebd4c1c77df5b.avif?t=1755181027\" width=800 height=366 /></span>With an innovative conviction's system, every choice not only shapes the ending but also the hero\u2019s personality, offering multiple paths and distinct finales.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849090/extras/bb1f6c2228b51acebca010b1af916455.avif?t=1755181027\" width=800 height=366 /></span><br>\u2694\ufe0f Test your reflexes, your strategic thinking, and your detective skills to survive \u2014 in this labyrinth, nothing comes for free, and every detail might be the key to uncovering the truth\u2026 or escaping from it.</p>",
